    <marc:datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
      <marc:subfield code="a">In Episode 9 the Fierce Earth Team takes viewers on a journey to one of the world&apos;s coldest and most hostile places on the planet - the Yukon Territory in Canada - to study the world&apos;s coldest climes. The team meets people who call this frozen place their home and finds out which animals are perfectly adapted to life in a sub-zero climate. They also get first-hand experience of surviving its freezing and life threatening temperatures and Leo attempts to climb a huge wall of sheer ice.</marc:subfield>
